                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I love coming back to this game.\nI started on console and now on PC and the devs are amazing.\nThis is not as simple as other puzzle games but when you learn how to attack and mix and match and aim to out think the others is a fun mind game.\nThe characters are a good mix up of styles. I like the double fused doll Alice/Anna and the gigachad muscle fairy\n\nIf you like puzzle games and want a new spin I say go for this style",
